{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Ultimate Bowling 是一款在 iPhone 上追求真實物理表現的立體保齡球遊戲，適合喜愛保齡球運動、又想隨時單機開局的玩家。遊戲以完整 3D 物理模擬呈現球速、旋轉與曲球軌跡，更可讓最多四人同機輪流，或透過藍牙與 Wi-Fi 本地對戰。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>真實物理與多種遊戲模式</h2>\n<p>操作提供揮動、陀螺儀與滑桿精準三種控制方式，揮動手勢可同時決定方向、力度與旋轉。內建經典、錦標賽、挑戰、放鬆與專業訓練五種模式，並可透過遊玩解鎖八款各具物理特性的球。遊戲備有即時計分表、保齡球指南及平均分與全中率統計圖表，並支援多位家庭成員檔案，全程離線運作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-273-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-274-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-275-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-276-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-277-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-278-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Ultimate Bowling – 3D Bowling</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T15:58:28.231366+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}